This directory holds Celeste's persona: the encrypted profiles
celeste_full.enc, celeste_spine.enc, celeste_lite.enc and celeste_off.enc,
and everything they decrypt to. They are NOT covered by the MIT License that
covers the rest of this repository (see NOTICE at the repository root).

No permission is granted to decrypt, extract, copy, modify, publish,
redistribute or sublicense the persona or any decrypted form of it, or to
use it to build or train other characters or models. You may run it only as
part of an unmodified official celeste release binary published by
whyKusanagi.

The encryption is a gate and a statement of these terms, not a secrecy
measure: official binaries carry the key. That the key can be found does
not grant any of the rights above.

SOURCE.json in this directory is integrity metadata (commit pins, sizes and
hashes). It contains no persona text and may be copied with the code.
